WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:26.614
A ship laden with sorrows

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:38.794
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:48.134
From the blackest depths

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:54.674
It rises to the surface

00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:09.794
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:21.544
Flying off into the vast sky

00:01:21.544 --> 00:01:35.724
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.844
One day during summer vacation,

00:01:52.844 --> 00:01:59.314
we set out to visit the Dorm Chief's family
and help out with their move.

00:01:59.314 --> 00:01:59.984
Hey, you! That joke's getting old!
We set out to visit the Dorm Chief's family
and help out with their move.

00:01:59.984 --> 00:02:03.184
Hey, you! That joke's getting old!

00:02:03.454 --> 00:02:04.754
Look at that!

00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:10.094
Wow!

00:02:10.424 --> 00:02:13.594
Do all of those boats belong
to your family, Dorm Chief?

00:02:13.964 --> 00:02:14.134
#27 Funatsumaru

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:17.904
#27 Funatsumaru
My family? Well, they belong
to my dad's company.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:18.624
#27 Funatsumaru

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:21.924
It is pretty impressive when
they're all together like this!

00:02:22.034 --> 00:02:22.674
Of course! It's the biggest
operation in these parts!

00:02:22.674 --> 00:02:25.844
Funatsumaru Fishery
Of course! It's the biggest
operation in these parts!

00:02:25.844 --> 00:02:27.304
Funatsumaru Fishery

00:02:29.174 --> 00:02:30.774
They've spotted us!

00:02:31.144 --> 00:02:35.014
Go ahead, wave back. You'll make their day!

00:02:37.554 --> 00:02:39.244
Hey!

00:02:43.494 --> 00:02:45.424
Hey!

00:02:46.894 --> 00:02:51.334
There's something romantic about
boats moving to a new port.

00:02:51.764 --> 00:02:53.564
Hey!

00:02:53.704 --> 00:02:57.404
I couldn't help feeling like something
exciting was going to happen...

00:03:07.454 --> 00:03:10.354
An unsullied heart.

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.424
Funatsumaru Fishery

00:03:12.424 --> 00:03:14.424
Funatsumaru Fishery
Thanks so much!

00:03:14.424 --> 00:03:14.524
Funatsumaru Fishery

00:03:14.524 --> 00:03:16.924
Funatsumaru Fishery
Sure. I'm going to go pitch in now, too.

00:03:16.924 --> 00:03:17.324
Sure. I'm going to go pitch in now, too.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:21.164
I'll give you a lift on the way back, too.
Just give me call.

00:03:21.294 --> 00:03:22.594
I appreciate it!

00:03:22.594 --> 00:03:24.264
Thank you!

00:03:27.274 --> 00:03:29.474
Wow, this is amazing!

00:03:29.474 --> 00:03:31.304
Your house is huge, Dorm Chief!

00:03:32.174 --> 00:03:34.144
Well, come on in!

00:03:35.874 --> 00:03:37.144
Michi!

00:03:37.514 --> 00:03:38.274
Yes!

00:03:41.614 --> 00:03:44.844
I'm home! I brought everyone!

00:03:45.254 --> 00:03:48.124
Welcome! Thank you for coming!

00:03:48.454 --> 00:03:50.014
Thanks for having us!

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:03.074
I wonder what she's thinking?

00:04:06.104 --> 00:04:07.544
Who knows?

00:04:07.674 --> 00:04:11.404
It's hard to tell what she's looking at.

00:04:11.944 --> 00:04:14.004
Oh! She looked at me!

00:04:16.254 --> 00:04:19.054
Okay, now, quit gawking!

00:04:20.554 --> 00:04:23.754
Well, well! Aren't you lucky, Noriko!

00:04:24.394 --> 00:04:27.454
All these pretty girls here to visit!

00:04:29.264 --> 00:04:31.464
I'll take that, Sis!

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:33.874
Oh? Well, thank you!

00:04:33.874 --> 00:04:40.964
Honestly, isn't one baby enough trouble?
You should use your head a little!

00:04:41.444 --> 00:04:45.244
I hope you're not going to keep
popping one out each year!

00:04:45.344 --> 00:04:46.874
Silly!

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:51.014
The Dorm Chief's sister sure is beautiful!

00:04:51.354 --> 00:04:52.684
Sure is.

00:04:52.754 --> 00:04:55.284
Hard to believe they come from
the same gene pool!

00:04:55.494 --> 00:04:57.284
Did you say something?!

00:05:13.474 --> 00:05:14.844
Sorry about that!

00:05:15.044 --> 00:05:19.874
She's getting her molars,
and her gums are sore.

00:05:20.814 --> 00:05:24.084
We have to give her this to chew
or she spits all over.

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:27.924
Here, Noriko! Chew on this!

00:05:32.694 --> 00:05:36.094
Such a mysterious lifeform...

00:05:55.054 --> 00:05:56.484
Ta-da!

00:05:57.384 --> 00:05:59.874
You're going swimming already?

00:06:00.154 --> 00:06:04.094
Of course! Aren't you, Michi?

00:06:05.394 --> 00:06:10.024
I have to come up with a story for the play...

00:06:10.164 --> 00:06:13.604
Too bad... after we came all this way!

00:06:15.574 --> 00:06:17.564
Michiko can't swim!

00:06:17.904 --> 00:06:21.904
Yes, I can! Only about eight meters, though...

00:06:30.184 --> 00:06:36.354
Geez, Hagino's taking forever!
Wonder what she's doing!

00:06:41.094 --> 00:06:42.584
How's Azanael?

00:06:42.794 --> 00:06:46.864
I can't say she's in the best frame of mind,

00:06:47.404 --> 00:06:50.134
but there's really nothing
to report at the moment.

00:06:50.744 --> 00:06:53.434
Please relax and enjoy your holiday.

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.704
Perhaps I should stop in for a bit...

00:06:57.284 --> 00:06:58.414
That's not necessary!

00:06:58.414 --> 00:07:00.074
Haginooo!

00:07:02.114 --> 00:07:04.844
Where are you? We're going on ahead!

00:07:15.894 --> 00:07:19.454
Quiet! That's enough!

00:07:22.974 --> 00:07:24.564
I want to see Ekaril!

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:27.704
I told you, you can't see her now!

00:07:27.944 --> 00:07:34.474
Why not? I just want to speak to the commander
of this ship! What's wrong with that?

00:07:34.614 --> 00:07:39.484
The commander is currently... on vacation.

00:07:40.724 --> 00:07:42.314
A vacation?!

00:07:42.594 --> 00:07:44.594
What the hell is going on here?!

00:07:44.594 --> 00:07:47.154
It can't be helped! The commander...

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:48.694
really needs...

00:07:52.834 --> 00:07:54.394
...some relaxation.

00:07:55.074 --> 00:07:57.334
I don't expect you to understand.

00:07:58.174 --> 00:07:59.804
H-hey!

00:08:00.414 --> 00:08:02.344
Relaxation?

00:08:13.924 --> 00:08:16.584
Is the construction done at the new port?

00:08:16.794 --> 00:08:22.694
Yes, mostly. There's just some loose ends to
take care of before they move the boats today.

00:08:24.304 --> 00:08:26.364
So it's moving day already!

00:08:26.364 --> 00:08:29.774
So this is my last summer
vacation at this house...

00:08:32.304 --> 00:08:33.904
Yes.

00:08:41.414 --> 00:08:43.974
There's really nobody here!

00:08:49.594 --> 00:08:50.714
See any fish?

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:53.484
You scared me!

00:08:53.794 --> 00:08:55.594
The water sure is clear!

00:08:57.734 --> 00:08:58.994
Yes.

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:06.874
Hey! Want to swim out to that rock?

00:09:07.414 --> 00:09:09.714
Out there? Isn't it dangerous?

00:09:09.714 --> 00:09:13.144
Nah, it's fine! Want to race?

00:09:14.214 --> 00:09:17.744
It looks deep. Let's go over to that shoal.

00:09:23.894 --> 00:09:25.154
Mari?

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:30.264
What is it?

00:09:44.884 --> 00:09:46.574
I'm going on ahead!

00:10:21.714 --> 00:10:23.014
No contest!

00:10:26.024 --> 00:10:27.384
Huh?

00:10:31.594 --> 00:10:36.994
Sorry, Hiroko... Could you call me a taxi?

00:10:38.534 --> 00:10:41.694
I've been having contractions...

00:10:41.934 --> 00:10:43.664
Why didn't you say so!

00:10:49.144 --> 00:10:50.514
I'm getting wet!

00:10:53.714 --> 00:10:56.274
Rain?! Sheesh!

00:11:01.454 --> 00:11:02.754
Hey...

00:11:02.754 --> 00:11:05.724
Hey! Where are you?

00:11:17.844 --> 00:11:22.364
Mom's going straight to the
hospital since it's closer.

00:11:23.014 --> 00:11:25.084
The cab should be here soon.

00:11:25.084 --> 00:11:27.884
Dad's got his hands full at the new port,

00:11:27.884 --> 00:11:29.974
and you're husband's still in Tokyo...

00:11:32.724 --> 00:11:34.344
Want me to come along?

00:11:34.594 --> 00:11:41.464
No. Not in this weather.
I'll take Sis in and come right back.

00:11:41.464 --> 00:11:43.434
You look after Noriko till then.

00:11:43.594 --> 00:11:45.194
Oh, right.

00:11:45.804 --> 00:11:47.164
Sorry to trouble you.

00:11:48.474 --> 00:11:51.704
Just give her a bottle.

00:12:00.144 --> 00:12:01.774
The taxi's here!

00:12:21.834 --> 00:12:25.394
You stupid! I thought
something happened to you!

00:12:31.114 --> 00:12:33.304
I've had it!

00:12:58.504 --> 00:13:01.064
The bath's open.

00:13:05.444 --> 00:13:06.714
By the way...

00:13:09.484 --> 00:13:13.014
It's not like I was worried about you!

00:13:16.794 --> 00:13:19.594
What's so funny! Take your bath already!

00:13:19.964 --> 00:13:21.054
Okay.

00:13:38.944 --> 00:13:39.814
Hmm?

00:13:39.814 --> 00:13:41.254
Took you long enough!

00:13:41.254 --> 00:13:42.744
I'm sorry!

00:13:43.814 --> 00:13:46.044
The roads were all flooded!

00:13:48.424 --> 00:13:50.254
I've got to head back.

00:13:50.254 --> 00:13:51.494
How come?

00:13:51.494 --> 00:13:53.794
Noriko. I left her with the girls.

00:13:53.794 --> 00:13:54.024
Delivery Room
Noriko. I left her with the girls.

00:13:54.024 --> 00:13:55.184
Delivery Room

00:13:57.334 --> 00:13:58.994
Congratulations!

00:13:59.134 --> 00:14:04.164
It's a healthy girl. 2875 grams!

00:14:04.604 --> 00:14:06.374
Another girl, huh?

00:14:08.344 --> 00:14:10.174
A female line...

00:14:17.624 --> 00:14:19.644
Why's she crying so much?

00:14:20.384 --> 00:14:22.014
You gave her her milk, right?

00:14:22.624 --> 00:14:26.684
I gave her the bottle they left,
but she didn't take much.

00:14:26.994 --> 00:14:28.724
Don't tell me she's sick or something?

00:14:36.174 --> 00:14:38.604
I know what it is. Her diaper.

00:14:42.544 --> 00:14:43.704
Akane?

00:14:44.814 --> 00:14:48.014
No way! I've got no experience with babies!

00:14:48.414 --> 00:14:50.044
Well, I don't either!

00:14:51.684 --> 00:14:53.624
I don't know what to do either!

00:14:58.824 --> 00:15:01.354
All right! I'll do it!

00:15:06.234 --> 00:15:08.064
Get me something to wipe her!

00:15:08.234 --> 00:15:10.034
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:15:11.144 --> 00:15:12.844
Don't move!

00:15:12.844 --> 00:15:14.604
Oh, geez!

00:15:23.214 --> 00:15:24.884
Wow.

00:15:25.284 --> 00:15:28.124
We were like that, once!

00:15:30.124 --> 00:15:31.194
A bath!

00:15:31.194 --> 00:15:34.064
Now, isn't that going a little far?

00:15:34.534 --> 00:15:37.124
I'm sure the Dorm Chief will be back soon.

00:15:37.934 --> 00:15:41.364
But the poor thing was filthy,
and all we did was wipe her!

00:15:43.274 --> 00:15:48.734
We should wash her off properly.
Besides, I know just the girl for the job!

00:15:48.944 --> 00:15:49.914
The girl...

00:15:49.914 --> 00:15:51.644
...for the job?

00:16:09.594 --> 00:16:11.424
Hey! Where are you?

00:16:11.864 --> 00:16:14.194
Answer me, please!

00:16:14.374 --> 00:16:16.234
Hagino!

00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:18.634
No...

00:16:19.574 --> 00:16:22.404
This can't be happening!

00:16:36.124 --> 00:16:39.924
Hey. I've got a job for you!

00:16:48.504 --> 00:16:49.804
Yes?

00:16:50.074 --> 00:16:52.004
Yes, this is the Funatsumaru residence.

00:16:52.374 --> 00:16:53.964
Oh, Dorm Chief!

00:16:54.144 --> 00:16:55.664
Yes, it's me.

00:16:56.044 --> 00:16:58.104
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:16:58.314 --> 00:16:59.834
I'm heading back now.

00:16:59.984 --> 00:17:01.244
How's Noriko?

00:17:01.384 --> 00:17:07.014
She's fine. Mari and Miss Senkoji
are giving her a bath!

00:17:07.284 --> 00:17:13.424
What?! Those amateurs?! Do they know how?

00:17:13.964 --> 00:17:17.764
Don't worry. It's Miss Senkoji, after all.

00:17:18.064 --> 00:17:21.794
Besides, babies like the water.

00:17:22.774 --> 00:17:28.144
They can swim right after birth. I saw it on TV!

00:17:28.444 --> 00:17:30.674
Isn't life amazing!

00:17:33.614 --> 00:17:35.514
Well, anyway, I'll be right there!

00:17:35.784 --> 00:17:38.654
Forget this bath business! When I get home...

00:17:38.654 --> 00:17:42.244
Huh? Hello? Hellooo?

00:17:44.824 --> 00:17:46.194
The line's dead!

00:17:48.134 --> 00:17:50.324
If I don't get home soon...

00:17:51.704 --> 00:17:53.224
...they'll kill that baby!

00:17:59.174 --> 00:18:00.274
Oh?

00:18:00.274 --> 00:18:01.974
Ms. Funatsumaru...

00:18:04.414 --> 00:18:06.404
Funatsumaru Fishery.

00:18:06.714 --> 00:18:11.654
There's no way through now.
The highway's closed due to mudslides!

00:18:11.754 --> 00:18:13.584
Funatsumaru Fishery.

00:18:13.584 --> 00:18:16.114
Like I said, the road's closed...

00:18:16.294 --> 00:18:20.254
Fu-na-tsu-ma-ru!

00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:40.344
Animal instinct...

00:18:44.454 --> 00:18:45.784
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:46.724 --> 00:18:48.014
Here's your milk!

00:18:48.094 --> 00:18:49.254
Thanks...

00:18:50.024 --> 00:18:51.044
Ow!

00:18:51.924 --> 00:18:53.264
It's boiling hot!

00:18:53.264 --> 00:18:57.564
I thought it should be nice and hot...
was I wrong?

00:18:57.564 --> 00:18:57.634
No Access
Road Closed
Authorized Personnel Only
I thought it should be nice and hot...
was I wrong?

00:18:57.634 --> 00:19:00.164
No Access
Road Closed
Authorized Personnel Only

00:19:00.164 --> 00:19:01.934
No Access
Road Closed
Authorized Personnel Only
I knew it!

00:19:02.704 --> 00:19:04.724
I tried to tell you...

00:19:05.944 --> 00:19:07.104
Keep the lights on.

00:19:07.814 --> 00:19:08.934
Huh?!

00:19:11.484 --> 00:19:12.784
Hey, now...

00:19:12.784 --> 00:19:14.644
That's dangerous! Miss!

00:19:14.754 --> 00:19:16.654
If I don't get home soon...

00:19:18.684 --> 00:19:20.414
...they'll kill that baby!

00:19:26.864 --> 00:19:31.354
She's drinking it! She was hungry!

00:19:32.064 --> 00:19:35.434
Yes... Look at her go!

00:19:38.004 --> 00:19:39.764
Finally... it's quieted down!

00:19:40.144 --> 00:19:41.304
Welcome back!

00:19:41.614 --> 00:19:43.274
Oh, she's drinking it!

00:19:43.274 --> 00:19:46.114
I guess you were right to cool it down!

00:19:47.714 --> 00:19:51.014
Yeah, it even said so on the can!

00:19:53.454 --> 00:19:57.784
Wow! She drank it all up!

00:19:59.064 --> 00:20:01.424
Well, that's good!

00:20:01.764 --> 00:20:04.394
By the way, what are you working on, Kozuki?

00:20:04.604 --> 00:20:06.564
I, uh...

00:20:06.734 --> 00:20:11.174
Oh, the script for the play? Can I see?

00:20:11.174 --> 00:20:12.644
No! Don't look!

00:20:12.644 --> 00:20:13.944
I'll go wash this.
C'mon, what's the harm?

00:20:13.944 --> 00:20:14.244
C'mon, what's the harm?

00:20:14.244 --> 00:20:15.734
Stop! I said no!

00:20:25.154 --> 00:20:28.024
I said, no!

00:20:29.294 --> 00:20:30.854
Sorry, sorry!

00:20:30.854 --> 00:20:33.414
We're just dying to see!

00:20:33.494 --> 00:20:36.484
Besides, I haven't even written anything yet!

00:20:36.664 --> 00:20:40.194
She hasn't written anything yet.
Isn't that too bad!

00:20:51.214 --> 00:20:52.374
No...

00:20:52.584 --> 00:20:54.914
No!

00:21:04.664 --> 00:21:06.384
You called for me, Commander?

00:21:06.594 --> 00:21:07.824
Yes.

00:21:09.564 --> 00:21:10.794
Here.

00:21:12.434 --> 00:21:14.694
This is... for me?

00:21:18.374 --> 00:21:19.674
Thank you.

00:21:21.374 --> 00:21:22.864
Commander!

00:21:35.394 --> 00:21:36.584
Commander!

00:22:04.784 --> 00:22:07.184
They're cute when they're sleeping...

00:22:20.134 --> 00:22:23.534
Hello? Commander Ekaril!

00:22:25.004 --> 00:22:28.404
Just kidding! Yeah, right!

00:22:45.124 --> 00:22:47.494
I-I'm back.

00:22:49.764 --> 00:22:51.754
Glad you all survived it.

00:22:53.034 --> 00:22:57.024
You're a big sister now, too.
You'll have to help out!

00:23:00.374 --> 00:23:02.074
Good job, everyone!

00:23:02.374 --> 00:23:03.964
Thanks for everything!

00:23:04.514 --> 00:23:05.874
Good night!

00:23:29.004 --> 00:23:36.464
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:23:37.274 --> 00:23:47.324
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:23:47.324 --> 00:23:54.994
A gentle breeze blowing

00:23:55.694 --> 00:24:03.574
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:07.774
The passing time

00:24:07.774 --> 00:24:13.114
Quietly watches over you

00:24:13.314 --> 00:24:17.054
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:17.054 --> 00:24:22.544
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:23.894 --> 00:24:28.194
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:28.194 --> 00:24:33.034
Searching for answers in life

00:24:33.034 --> 00:24:37.334
Always believing in the day

00:24:37.334 --> 00:24:43.044
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:24:43.044 --> 00:24:47.004
In the blue dreams!

00:25:01.594 --> 00:25:06.194
Michiko struggles to write a
play for the school festival.

00:25:06.464 --> 00:25:10.064
Overwhelmed by the pressure,
she flees the school.

00:25:11.074 --> 00:25:15.514
Meanwhile, aboard Blue,
Azanael concocts plans of destruction,

00:25:15.514 --> 00:25:20.674
and Tsubael replays her beloved
Onomil's last moments.

00:25:21.854 --> 00:25:27.514
Next time on Blue Drop: Hyoscyamus Niger.
